TmuxAgentWatch
Copyright 2026 sjdhome

This macOS app is a Swift port of tmux-agent-watch
(https://github.com/sjdhome/tmux-agent-watch, Apache-2.0), preserving its
functionality and detection semantics.

Detection manifests (TmuxAgentWatch/Resources/manifests.json, converted from
TOML by scripts/convert-manifests.py) and the detection engine, agent
identification, and macOS foreground-process discovery logic are derived from
herdr (https://github.com/ogulcancelik/herdr), licensed under the Apache
License, Version 2.0.
